        "description": "MENU: “That giant skeleton at the bottom of the caves almost looks real.”\nMINA: “It does a real enough job of holding our Operator back.”\nMINA: “And the magic is so thick in the air you can taste it.”\nMENU: “I knew you were sharing sight, but taste?”\nMINA: “It’s just an expression.”\nMINA: “But spend some time in here and taste for yourself.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 97,
        "name": "Back of my Hand",
        "description": "MINA: “The deeper we venture into these caves, the stronger the sense of foreboding that I feel.”\nMINA: “It’s almost as if the caves drain my spirit through my connection to you.”\nMINA: “Do me a favor, servant.”\nMINA: “Give me an energy drink?”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 98,
        "name": "Heartwood",
        "description": "MENU: “That dowsing rod is wiggling again.”\nMINA: “The Blooming Tree has a certain presence. I’m not surprised.”\nMINA: “Something similar may have happened here.” ",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 99,
        "name": "Hypersensitivity",
        "description": "MENU: “The dowsing rod is going off here? Is it bugged?”\nMENU: “Mina, what’s the deal?”\nMINA: “My shop is small. It’s a tight space. The dowsing rod is probably just picking up the leftover residue on the operator.”\nMINA: “Check outside my door, in the open air. You won’t find anything, I’m sure.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 100,
        "name": "Prima Facie",
        "description": "MENU: “What kind of creepy decoration is this?”\nMINA: “Looks like a skeleton.”\nMENU: “Yeah, but it must be a model. The craftsmanship is really impressive.”\nMENU: “Operator, check this place out for a while with your Kami. I can run an analysis.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 101,
        "name": "Pillars of the Earth",
        "description": "MINA: “Our dear friend Menu is having a hard time accepting the reality of this great corpse.”\nMINA: “Yes, of course it’s real. In fact, I recognize him.”\nMINA: “He was an old friend and mentor. Someone I thought would hang on forever.”\nMINA: “I’d like you to pay respects on my behalf.”\nMINA: “He loved a drink. Pour out something strong for him.”\nMINA: “This may not be a proper grave, but he would appreciate the gesture all the same.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 102,
        "name": "Axis Mundi",
        "description": "MENU: “This is the deepest part of the cave system.”\nMENU: “We’re deep below the central point of Kamigotchi World’s axial mountain.”\nMENU: “The location just feels important.”\nMENU: “These pillars and brickwork don’t match anything else in the caves, aesthetically. Let me run some scans.\nMENU: “You might trust the results more than I do, though.” \nMENU: “I’ll check the marble. You grab some stuff from the room to compare.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 103,
        "name": "Sealed Fate",
        "description": "MENU: “Hey, the dowsing rod is wiggling.”\nMENU: “I almost didn’t notice it in there. It’s barely moving.”\nMENU: “Actually, it seems to be indicating something below, not in the sacrarium itself.”\nMENU: “I don’t think you’ll be swimming through ooze anytime soon. It might even be deeper than that pool.”\nMENU: “Might as well put it out of your mind for now.”\nMINA: “Not so fast.”\nMINA: “Do me the favor of spending a few hours investigating. And tell me all the details.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 104,
        "name": "An Ounce of Sense",
        "description": "MINA: “You’ve probably collected all six of the sensory essences by now.”\nMINA: “If not, what are you waiting for? You won’t get far in this lesson without them.”\nMINA: “You may have already learned how they can be used to augment hexerei.”\nMINA: “Or perhaps you’ve experienced the magical effects that raw sensation can produce on its own.”\nMINA: “Each one of these sensory essences carries a great power.”\nMINA: “But together, they combine to produce something truly sublime.”\nMINA: “Craft one Pure Essence and I will explain further.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 105,
        "name": "The Turning of the Wheel",
        "description": "MENU: “That huge engraved door has opened.”\nMENU: “I wonder what’s behind it?”\nMINA: “The whole of the Sanctuary Caves seems to have been manipulated in order to generate sensory essences.”\nMINA: “I had believed it was part of a complex lock to keep curious visitors out, but now I’m not so sure.”\nMENU: “You’re saying it was like a test, or a puzzle? They wanted us to open it?”\nMINA: “Something like that, yes.”\nMENU: “It is what it is. Go check it out, Operator.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 106,
        "name": "Two Faces Under One Hood",
        "description": "MINA: “See if the Kami can tolerate the presence of that individual.”\nMINA: “Your little spirits are a fine judge of character.”\nMINA: “Put them down and get them busy, then check in on them later.”\nMENU: “Is it an individual, or do they count as two people?”\nMENU: “That might be rude to ask…”\nMENU: “Anyway, Mina and I can take a closer look at this room while the Kami are busy.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 107,
        "name": "Get a Foot In The Door",
        "description": "DIMIDIATUS: “We have communicated with the local guardian deity and explained our contract.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “She understands we are not at odds.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “We suggest an exchange of gifts to increase our amity.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “We have heard you enjoy collecting cards.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “Bring us some of the sanguine mushrooms that grow in this place, and we will make a trade.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 108,
        "name": "Treat Yourself",
        "description": "DIMIDIATUS: “You have sated our needs, but a desire lingers.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “We are burdened by what you call a sweet tooth, notwithstanding our lack of dentition.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “Bring us a handful of candy. We will compensate your efforts.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 109,
        "name": "Remain Unburdened of Attachments",
        "description": "DIMIDIATUS: “You have become attached to this world.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “One may perceive this as good, or bad, or both. But it is a restrictive condition.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “You may not want to let things go. You may feel scared.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “You may act as a guardian to the spirits in your charge. You may refuse to let them fall in battle.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “You may be a confident hexer, assured that your stockpile of magic can bring back any loss.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “You must abandon these attachments.”\nDIMIDIATUS: “Give up your powers of revival as a symbolic gesture.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 2001,
        "name": "Grand Opening",
        "description": "MINA: “Hello, whoever you are. Is this how you receive your letters?”\nMINA: “It seems functional, although inelegant.”\nMINA: “Tired? Hungry? $MUSU burning a hole in your pocket?”\nMINA: “Bring your wallet to the Tunnel of Trees and knock on the blue door.”\nMINA: “——— Mina.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
        "index": 2002,
        "name": "Customer Loyalty Program",
        "description": "MINA: “I want you to be a repeat customer.”\nMINA: “If you trade enough $MUSU with me, I’ll give you something special.”\nMINA: ”I don’t care how you get it. Just bring me more and I’ll be happy.”\nMINA: “——— Mina.”",
        "repeatable": false
      },
      {
